# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private source material — NEVER COMMITTED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is the published one. Nothing private should ever reach it, but
# the same guard as skill-lab applies here as defence in depth.
#
#   refs/       source material a skill was derived from
#   _private/   anything else that must stay local
#
# WARNING: `refs/` is NOT `references/`.
#   refs/        private, ignored, never shipped.
#   references/  part of the skill's published payload, always committed.
refs/
_private/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Written into claude/ by Claude Code, not published from the lab
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A user skills directory linked to claude/ receives Claude Code's own account
# skill sync under synced/. None of it is built or published from skill-lab.
claude/synced/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
